Swiftify links Qt's libraries dynamically, so they can be swapped for a
modified build of Qt @Qt6_VERSION@. Qt's source is at
https://download.qt.io/archive/qt/@Qt6_VERSION_MAJOR@.@Qt6_VERSION_MINOR@/@Qt6_VERSION@/single/
